WEBVTT

00:00:08.443 --> 00:00:10.243
You wanna go to the village?

00:00:10.323 --> 00:00:14.403
Rule number one out here,
always... No.

00:00:15.043 --> 00:00:17.043
Never go out in a blizzard.

00:00:17.163 --> 00:00:19.443
We need to get to Boo.

00:00:21.643 --> 00:00:23.563
Boo? What about us?

00:00:24.683 --> 00:00:27.643
Ever since the kid came in,
you've ignored everything I've said,

00:00:27.723 --> 00:00:32.883
and now look where we are!
We were about to break the record.

00:00:32.923 --> 00:00:35.483
-We would have had it made.
-None of that matters now.

00:00:37.163 --> 00:00:39.483
None of it matters?
Wait a second.

00:00:39.723 --> 00:00:41.763
None of it matters?

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:46.643
OK. No, good. Great.

00:00:47.403 --> 00:00:49.603
So now the truth comes out, doesn't it?

00:00:51.443 --> 00:00:54.803
Would you look at that?
We're out of snow cones.

00:00:54.883 --> 00:00:57.683
Let me just go outside
and make some more.

00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:02.163
Sulley, what about everything
we ever worked for?

00:01:03.043 --> 00:01:04.763
Does that matter?

00:01:06.123 --> 00:01:07.683
What about Celia?

00:01:07.763 --> 00:01:11.003
I am never...
Never gonna see her again.

00:01:11.923 --> 00:01:13.163
Doesn't that matter?

00:01:18.883 --> 00:01:20.283
And what about me?

00:01:21.163 --> 00:01:23.683
I'm your pal. I'm your best friend.

00:01:24.883 --> 00:01:26.123
Don't I matter?

00:01:28.123 --> 00:01:29.483
(SIGHS)

00:01:29.563 --> 00:01:31.163
I'm sorry, Mike.

00:01:31.403 --> 00:01:33.363
I'm sorry we're stuck out here.

00:01:33.843 --> 00:01:35.923
I didn't mean for this to happen.

00:01:36.283 --> 00:01:38.123
But Boo's in trouble.

00:01:38.283 --> 00:01:41.243
I think there might be
a way to save her if we can just get...

00:01:41.483 --> 00:01:43.963
We? Whoa. We?

00:01:44.163 --> 00:01:47.563
No. There's no "we" this time, pal.

00:01:47.963 --> 00:01:51.323
If you want to go out there
and freeze to death,

00:01:51.963 --> 00:01:53.563
you be my guest.

00:01:54.523 --> 00:01:56.643
Because you're on your own.

00:02:33.723 --> 00:02:35.923
Hey, I got more snow cones!

00:02:55.403 --> 00:02:56.763
(YELLS)

00:02:58.643 --> 00:03:00.003
(GROANING)

00:03:09.803 --> 00:03:11.403
(DISTANT CHILD SCREAMING)

00:03:23.243 --> 00:03:26.243
Come on, George.
I know you can do this.

00:03:26.323 --> 00:03:28.483
I picked out an easy door for you.

00:03:28.603 --> 00:03:31.763
In Nepal. Nice, quiet Nepal.

00:03:31.843 --> 00:03:34.963
You know, you're right.
Here. Take this.

00:03:35.043 --> 00:03:36.803
Go get 'em, Georgie.

00:03:36.923 --> 00:03:38.403
Look out. Coming through.

00:03:38.443 --> 00:03:41.243
-Sorry, George.
-Hey, you can't just...

00:03:41.323 --> 00:03:43.603
(GASPS) Twenty-three...

00:03:47.803 --> 00:03:48.923
(WHISTLES)

00:03:49.003 --> 00:03:50.683
Out of the way!

00:03:51.883 --> 00:03:53.603
(WHIMPERS)

00:03:56.043 --> 00:03:59.123
Finally. I never should have
trusted you with this.

00:03:59.203 --> 00:04:01.803
Because of you,
I had to banish my top scarer.

00:04:02.283 --> 00:04:04.483
With this machine,
we won't need scarers.

00:04:04.563 --> 00:04:06.483
Sullivan got what he deserved.

00:04:06.763 --> 00:04:09.603
Sullivan was twice the scarer
you will ever be.

00:04:09.683 --> 00:04:10.803
(LOW GROWL)

00:04:23.803 --> 00:04:24.803
Kitty!

00:04:27.723 --> 00:04:29.123
(SCREAMING)

00:04:29.163 --> 00:04:30.323
(ROARING)

00:04:32.003 --> 00:04:33.563
-Kitty!
-Sullivan?

00:04:40.163 --> 00:04:42.283
-Kitty!
-Sorry, Boo.

00:04:42.483 --> 00:04:44.083
Stop him!

00:04:44.683 --> 00:04:46.443
Let's get you home.

00:04:47.363 --> 00:04:49.083
(PANTING)

00:04:50.043 --> 00:04:51.443
WATERNOOSE: Finish him off!

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:02.843
You don't know how long
I've wanted to do that, Sullivan.

